    "title": "京张智谷：人字形折返治理走廊",
    "titleEn": "Jingzhang AI Valley: Switchback Governance Corridor",
    "summary": "以京张铁路人字形展线与折返换向为制度原型，建立城市AI'折返评估—坡度准入—K标版本'的治理走廊，让每一次城市智能都沿轨道可查、可停、可回头。",
    "summaryEn": "Using the Ren-shaped switchback line and turn-around operation of the Jingzhang Railway as an institutional prototype, this proposal establishes a governance corridor of switchback review, grade-based access, and K-marker versioning for urban AI, so that every urban intelligence stays traceable, stoppable, and reversible along the track.",
