    "id": "surenny/jingzhang-unknown-zero",
    "slug": "jingzhang-unknown-zero",
    "title": "京张不判空 / JINGZHANG UNKNOWN≠ZERO COMMONS",
    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG UNKNOWN≠ZERO COMMONS / 京张不判空",
    "summary": "当数字系统没有看见公共使用时，先把数据标为 unknown，而不是把使用判成零：保留等价普通任务面，只允许具名人员启动可逆对照试验，失败即还原且不以更多个人采集补救。",
    "summaryEn": "When digital systems do not observe public use, record unknown rather than zero: keep an equivalent ordinary-task reserve, permit only named human roles to start a reversible paired trial, and restore the original task on failure without collecting more personal data.",
