    "slug": "jingzhang-testbed-mile",
    "title": "京张验真里 Jing-Zhang Proof Mile",
    "titleEn": "Jing-Zhang Proof Mile",
    "summary": "以「每一项 AI 城市服务先走一里验证，再进入全带」为核心，用公开可读的验真票（非AI基线、责任人、试点边界、证据、停止条件、退出恢复）把京张遗产公园里程标串成三处验真场：众智园技术验真场、原点生活验真场、大钟寺市场验真场。强调 AI 关闭后仍完整服务的 L0 基线、公共服务前台与可验证后场、雨洪/热舒适/余热等物理绩效，已建公园与铁路遗产仅作待现场核验的设计接口。",
    "summaryEn": "Every AI urban service proves one mile before entering the whole belt. A public, readable Proof Ticket (non-AI baseline, responsible party, pilot boundary, evidence, stop condition, exit & recovery) links three proof fields along the Jing-Zhang heritage park mile markers: Zhongzhiyuan Technical Proof Field, Origin Living Proof Field, and Dazhongsi Market Proof Field. The package emphasizes the L0 baseline that keeps full service when AI is off, a public service front-stage with a verifiable back-stage, and physical performance such as stormwater, thermal comfort and waste heat. Existing parks and railway heritage are treated only as design interfaces for on-site verification, not as approved works.",
