    "title": "京张双轨带 JINGZHANG DUAL TRACK：双轨并进的百年京张AI创新带城市设计",
    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG DUAL TRACK: Urban Design for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "把百年京张AI创新带组织为一条双轨制城市轨道线：文化轨承载百年文脉与市民日常，创新轨承载AI全栈创新与全球生态，双轨以道岔节点实现转换、以同步规则防止脱轨；三处站场、两翼联络与公里标驿站构成可感知、可复算、可深化的空间系统。",
    "summaryEn": "The Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt is organised as a dual-track urban line: a culture rail carries heritage and everyday civic life, an innovation rail carries the full-stack AI ecosystem, switches make choice and conversion visible, and synchronisation rules prevent derailment; three station-yards, two wing corridors and kilometer-post waystations form a perceptible, recomputable and deepenable spatial system.",
