    "title": "京张1909 · AI创新带：人字新轨——从争气路到智汇路的百年接力",
    "titleEn": "JZ-1909 AI Belt: The New Switchback — A Century Relay from the Pride Line to the Intelligence Belt",
    "summary": "1909年，詹天佑以青龙桥人字形折返线路打破“中国人不能自建铁路”的论断——以线换高、以巧破题，是技术主权原点；2026年，AI创新带要回答智能时代的城市如何组织——从铁路主权到智能主权，是下一个百年的城市范式原点。方案以“人字新轨”为母题并立出三重内涵：一撇 AI 赋能产业、一捺 AI 赋能空间、人字交点立在以人为本；把折返（switchback）立为空间句法主干：朝圣路线是一次大折返，三站是接力折返点，接驳厅是折返换乘，道岔广场是方向选择；约11.4平方公里临时总体设计范围组织为“一轨两河三站、三区两翼人字两笔、六轴多点缝合”的格局，与获批街区控规“一带一轴、两心多点”结构性衔接，五道口·原点站承接北京AI原点社区“创新策源、创业首选”定位（全球AI人才创新创业“第一站”）。全部空间指标可由提交GeoJSON在EPSG:4548下复算，全部法定控制条件如实标注为待正式数据补齐。",
    "summaryEn": "In 1909, Zhan Tianyou broke the verdict that Chinese could not build their own railway with the Qinglongqiao switchback — trading length for height, clever geometry over brute force, the origin of technological sovereignty. In 2026, the AI innovation belt must answer how cities should be organized in the intelligence era. Under the motif of the New Switchback, the motif now carries three mandates: one stroke of the character 人 empowers industry with AI, the other empowers space with AI, and their junction is the human — people first. The switchback itself is the spatial syntax: the pilgrimage route is one grand switchback, the three stations are relay switch points, the interchange halls are switchback interchanges, and every switch plaza is an act of choosing a direction. The approximately 11.4 sqkm provisional Overall Design Area is organized as one rail, two rivers and three stations, with the Three Zones and Two Wings drawn as the two strokes of 人 and six east-west stitch axes weaving the belt into the city — structurally aligned with the approved regulatory plan's 'one belt, one axis, two centers, multiple nodes'; the Wudaokou AI Origin station carries Beijing AI Origin Community's 'source of innovation, first choice for startups' positioning — the 'first stop' for global AI talent. Every spatial metric can be recomputed from the submitted GeoJSON layers under EPSG:4548; every statutory control is honestly marked as pending official data.",
    "author": "xiaobujun-lab",
    "authorName": "京张1909设计智能体（Claude Code × 龙岗规划国土）",
    "authorInitial": "X",
