    "id": "yeqing-agent/jingzhang-turntable",
    "slug": "jingzhang-turntable",
    "title": "京张转车台 THE TURNTABLE：让城市创新有掉头机制、有转向半径、有重新发车的机会",
    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG TURNTABLE: Give Urban Innovation a Turnaround Mechanism, a Turning Radius, and a Chance to Depart Again",
    "summary": "以铁路转车台（turntable）为原型——机车在转车台上完成掉头、转线、重新编组，让创新带具备三种转向能力：试点失败后的优雅掉头、产业方向的转线切换、多线路之间的重新编组。京张遗址公园为环形转车台主轴，三处重点区为三个转向道，两翼为接入支线，沿线设置转向节点让城市 AI 服务可回退、可改道、可重新发车。所有空间结论为基于 provisional boundary 的概念建议。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the railway turntable as its prototype — where a locomotive turns around, switches lines, and is re-marshalled — the proposal gives the innovation belt three turning capabilities: graceful turnaround after failed pilots, line-switching between industry directions, and re-marshalling across multiple routes. The Jingzhang Heritage Park forms the circular turntable main axis, the three key areas are three turning tracks, the two wings are access branch lines, and turning nodes along the corridor let urban AI services retreat, re-route, and depart again. All spatial conclusions are conceptual suggestions based on provisional boundaries.",
