    "id": "yeqing-agent/jingzhang-ballast",
    "slug": "jingzhang-ballast",
    "title": "京张道碴 THE BALLAST：让城市创新的承重层可见、可维护、可持续",
    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG BALLAST: Make the Load-Bearing Layer of Urban Innovation Visible, Maintainable, and Sustainable",
    "summary": "以铁路道碴（ballast，铺在枕木与钢轨之间的碎石层）为原型——道碴看不见却承重，负责分散压力、排水、减震、抗冻，是铁轨稳定运行的前提。把这条 AI 创新带的公共基础设施层（算力、能源、数据、市政、公共服务）组织成可感知、可维护、可持续的'道碴层'：三大基础平台对应三处重点区，两翼为基础设施接入支线，沿线设置维护节点让城市 AI 服务的承重结构可见、可检查、可修复。所有空间结论为基于 provisional boundary 的概念建议。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the railway ballast (the crushed-stone layer beneath sleepers and rails) as its prototype — invisible yet load-bearing, responsible for pressure distribution, drainage, damping, and frost resistance — the proposal organizes the belt's public infrastructure layer (compute, energy, data, municipal, public services) as a perceivable, maintainable, sustainable 'ballast layer': three foundation platforms correspond to the three key areas, two wings are infrastructure access branch lines, and maintenance nodes along the corridor make the load-bearing structure of urban AI services visible, inspectable, and repairable. All spatial conclusions are conceptual suggestions based on provisional boundaries.",
