    "summary": "把京张铁路关沟段 33‰ 大坡道与人字展线的工程智慧，转译为 AI 创新带的「创新坡度协议」：按坡度分区供给城市空间（应用坡/研究坡/加速坡），以展线节点完成阶段换挡，以坡度信号实施分级治理。空间结论全部基于临时边界，属概念建议，可复算、可撤回、可深化。",
    "summaryEn": "Translating the 33‰ Guan'gou grade and the switchback alignment of the century-old Jing-Zhang Railway into an Innovation Gradient Protocol for the AI belt: space supplied by grade bands (applied/research/acceleration), stage changes at transfer nodes, and tiered governance by grade signals. All spatial conclusions are concept proposals on provisional boundaries - recomputable, reversible, and open to professional deepening.",
