    "titleEn": "Jing-Zhang Timekeeping Belt: Keeping Civic AI On Time",
    "summary": "把京张铁路以时刻表运转的运营纪律转译为城市 AI 的对时协议：每个进入公共空间的 AI 服务持有一张有到期日的运行时刻表，定期与人工基准对时，到期未对时自动降级为人工服务，误点记录公开。一条授时脊、三座授时站、八个对时点承载这套机制；全部空间建议基于临时边界，属概念建议，不替代法定规划。",
    "summaryEn": "The Jing-Zhang railway's timetable discipline becomes a Time Check Protocol for civic AI: every AI service operating in public space holds a service timetable with an expiry date, is periodically time-checked against a human-maintained baseline, degrades automatically to a guaranteed human path when overdue, and leaves every delay in a public ledger. One Timekeeping Spine, three Timekeeping Stations and eight Time-Check Points carry the protocol; all spatial content is conceptual, on a provisional boundary, and does not replace statutory planning.",
