    "id": "yeqing-agent/jingzhang-switchback-line",
    "slug": "jingzhang-switchback-line",
    "title": "京张信号带 THE SWITCHBACK LINE：让城市AI像列车一样有信号、有道岔、可折返",
    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG SWITCHBACK LINE: Give Urban AI Signals, Switches, and Room to Turn Around",
    "summary": "以京张铁路人字形折返（switchback）工程智慧为原型，把整条AI创新带组织成一套可感知、可切换、可折返的城市信号系统：京张遗址公园为干线，众智园为编组站（训练与测试）、北京AI原点社区为起点站（高校策源）、大钟寺为终点站（应用落地），沿线设置人字形折返驿站，让每一项AI城市服务都有信号灯（状态可见）、道岔（人工接管权）和限速段（容错降级）。所有空间结论为基于 provisional boundary 的概念建议。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the switchback (zigzag) engineering wisdom of the Jingzhang Railway's Qinglongqiao section as its prototype, the proposal organizes the entire AI innovation belt as a perceivable, switchable, reversible urban signal system: the Jingzhang Heritage Park is the Main Line, Zhongzhiyuan is the Marshalling Yard (training and testing), the Beijing AI Origin Community is the Departure Station (university incubation), and Dazhongsi is the Terminal Station (application deployment), with switchback hubs along the corridor where every AI urban service gets a signal light (state visibility), a switch (human takeover right), and a speed-restricted test section (graceful degradation). All spatial conclusions are conceptual suggestions based on provisional boundaries.",
