    "title": "京张信号 / THE JINGZHANG SIGNAL：从智能列控到可信AI的三灯城市",
    "titleEn": "THE JINGZHANG SIGNAL: From Intelligent Train Control to a Three-Light City of Trustworthy AI",
    "summary": "以京张铁路百年信号史为原型——从1909年詹天佑时代的人工旗语，到2019年世界首条时速350公里智能高铁的自动驾驶列控——提出'三灯治理协议'：让AI创新带上的每一个场景都明确自己的绿灯(可自主)、黄灯(需人工复核)与红灯(禁止)状态，形成一脊三站五线的可信AI城市结构。",
    "summaryEn": "Using the century-long signal history of the Jing-Zhang Railway as a prototype — from the manual flag signals of the Zhan Tianyou era in 1909 to the autonomous train control of the world's first 350 km/h intelligent high-speed railway in 2019 — this proposal introduces a Three-Light Governance Protocol: every AI scenario on the innovation belt declares its own Green (autonomous), Amber (human review required), and Red (prohibited) state, forming a one-spine, three-station, five-line structure for a trustworthy AI city.",
