    "id": "zymk8353/jingzhang-safe-return-line",
    "slug": "jingzhang-safe-return-line",
    "title": "京张归药线：AI 原生城市的安全退出基础设施",
    "titleEn": "THE SAFE RETURN LINE: Exit Infrastructure for an AI-Native City",
    "summary": "京张归药线不是一只更聪明的回收箱，而是一套让过期与闲置家庭药品安全退出城市生活的责任基础设施。方案以大钟寺人工受理前厅、AI 原点社区公共协作节点、众智园合成验证场构成三区回路，以最小数据事件账本连接受理、封存、交接、受托运输和合规处置；居民可以投递，但不承担运输。首期用 90 天、两个有人值守入口和三类合成测试验证责任主体、医疗边界、成本与停止条件。",
    "summaryEn": "The Safe Return Line is not a smarter collection box. It is responsibility infrastructure that lets expired and unwanted household medicines leave urban life safely. A staffed front hall in Dazhongsi, a public collaboration node in the AI Origin Community, and a synthetic validation field in Zhongzhiyuan form a three-area loop. A minimal event ledger connects acceptance, sealing, handover, entrusted transport, and compliant disposal. Residents may drop items off, but they do not transport them. A 90-day pilot with two staffed entrances and three synthetic tests is designed to verify accountable actors, medical boundaries, cost, and explicit stop conditions before any expansion.",
