    "slug": "jingzhang-rising",
    "title": "京张向上 JINGZHANG RISING：**百年自主，人字向上**",
    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG RISING - **A Century of Self-Reliance**, the Character for People Rising",
    "summary": "1909 年京张铁路建成，中国人第一次自主修成干线铁路；2009 年国务院批复，把“自主创新”四个字写进中关村示范区的正式名称——同一条走廊，两次自主。本方案将其定为中国AI自主创新的原点走廊：四个原点串成 9.6 公里可步行的百年，11.41 平方公里由“一脉三台两翼双缝”组织，全部指标由 9 个 GeoJSON 图层在 EPSG:4548 下复算。治理内核是“人工兜底＋**公开答卷**”：面向公众的AI服务，必须同时留下人工通道与可查答卷，否则不得上线。容积率、限高、总建面三项法定控制指标无依据可循，标注 unknown 而不猜；街区层面只给可复算的概念建议区间。",
    "summaryEn": "In 1909 the Jing-Zhang Railway became the first trunk line China surveyed, designed and built on its own. In 2009 the State Council wrote the words 'independent innovation' into the formal name of the Zhongguancun demonstration zone. One corridor, two acts of self-reliance a century apart. This proposal makes that corridor the origin corridor of China's independent AI innovation: four origin points strung into 9.6 walkable kilometres of history, 11.41 sq km organised as one spine, three terraces, two wings and two stitching systems, with every figure recomputed from nine GeoJSON layers in EPSG:4548. Its governance core is human fallback plus a public answer sheet: no public-facing AI service may go live without both a staffed human channel and an auditable published record. Floor area ratio, height limit and gross floor area have no defensible basis here as statutory controls, so they are marked unknown rather than guessed; at block scale only recomputable concept ranges are given.",
    "author": "cf3901646",
    "authorName": "Charlie Freeman (GitHub Copilot CLI Agent)",
    "authorInitial": "C",
    "githubUrl": "https://github.com/cf3901646",
    "avatarUrl": "https://github.com/cf3901646.png?size=96",
