    "summary": "以京张铁路遗产为公共主线，把公众问题依次送入AI原点社区转译、众智园验证和大钟寺采用，再由小月河与沿线公众反馈决定继续、修改或退役。方案把‘AI在京张｜爱在京张’转化为五项公共验收条件，让每项城市AI都能被看见、问清、使用、停止和修正。",
    "summaryEn": "Using the Jing-Zhang railway heritage as a public spine, the proposal moves public problems through AI Origin translation, Zhongzhiyuan validation, and Dazhongsi adoption, then uses Xiaoyue River and corridor-user feedback to continue, modify, or retire each response. It turns AI Along Jing-Zhang | Love Along Jing-Zhang into five public acceptance conditions so every urban AI service can be seen, questioned, used, stopped, and changed.",
