    "id": "zxw1992/jingzhang-warm-line",
    "slug": "jingzhang-warm-line",
    "title": "京张暖线 THE WARM LINE：把AI的余热、算力与停止开关还给城市",
    "titleEn": "THE WARM LINE: giving AI's waste heat, its compute and its off-switch back to the city",
    "summary": "AI 给城市带来两件很物理的事：它发热，它要近。本方案把这两件事变成空间制度——沿京张遗址公园9.4公里主脊布置13座“给算站”，要求每一份边缘算力的余热都交还给一处公共空间；13处东西缝合口把被铁路切开百年的两侧重新接上；调度厅、零号给算站与时延广场三处地标把“谁在调度AI”变成可见、可旁听、可中止的公共场所。",
    "summaryEn": "AI does two very physical things to a city: it makes heat, and it needs to be near. This proposal turns both into spatial rules — 13 Compute Watering Stations along the 9.4 km heritage-park spine, each required to hand its waste heat back to a named public space; 13 east-west stitching links reconnect the two sides the railway separated for a century; and three landmarks (Dispatch Hall, Station Zero, Latency Square) make the question of who dispatches the city's AI visible, attendable and stoppable.",
