    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG REN·ZHI — From the Ren-Shaped Railway to the Human-AI Symbiosis Belt",
    "summary": "以 1909 年詹天佑「人」字形铁路的工程精神为原点，把 9 公里京张铁路遗址公园升级为「人智脊」，串联北·加速椎节（众智园）、中·原点椎节（AI 原点社区）、南·汇聚椎节（大钟寺）三处重点区域，联动西·智服翼与东·场景翼，形成文化引流—场景体验—创新转化—服务放大的协同回路。方案包含 12 张 AI 场景卡（含 3 个产业测试验证场景）、6 类人才画像、4 处 AI 朝圣地标与三期分期实施建议；全部空间结论以 GeoJSON 表达并在 EPSG:4548 下机器复算，临时边界与数据缺口全程显式标注，不作任何官方红线或审批承诺。",
    "summaryEn": "JINGZHANG REN·ZHI upgrades the 9 km Jingzhang Railway Heritage Park into the REN·ZHI Spine, linking three key vertebrae - Zhongzhiyuan (Accelerator), AI Origin Community (Origin) and Dazhongsi (Convergence) - plus two functional wings. The proposal delivers 12 AI scenario cards (including three industrial test-and-verification scenarios), six personas, four AI-pilgrimage landmarks and a three-phase implementation concept. All spatial claims are expressed as GeoJSON, machine-recomputed in EPSG:4548, with provisional boundaries and data gaps explicitly labeled. No official redline or approval is claimed.",
