    "id": "HYKQL-K/jingzhang-proving-belt",
    "slug": "jingzhang-proving-belt",
    "title": "京张智带 · 城市验证长廊",
    "titleEn": "Jing-Zhang Intelligence Belt · The Urban Proving Corridor",
    "summary": "把百年京张AI创新带设计成一条持续运转、可被公众审计的城市验证长廊。方案提出可复制的最小单位——验证单元，由空间载体、验证协议、公示看板和退出机制四件套构成，沿京张遗址公园形成九段五带的空间骨架，串联众智园、AI原点社区、大钟寺三区，并由中关村科技服务翼与小月河场景赋能翼供给资源和需求。核心机制是提案、验证、公示、转化的闭环，并配套三条硬约束：失败必须公示、人工兜底路径不得更慢更贵、默认不参与。方案在主办方临时粗略范围上完成拓扑无缝的用地分区、指标复算和分期安排，官方精确红线公开后可整体复算。",
    "summaryEn": "This proposal reframes the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt as a continuously operating, publicly auditable urban proving corridor. Its core original device is the validation unit, a replicable minimum unit composed of a spatial carrier, a validation protocol, a public disclosure board, and an exit mechanism. Nine longitudinal segments and five transverse bands form the spatial skeleton along the Jing-Zhang Heritage Park, linking the three key areas of Zhongzhiyuan, the Beijing AI Origin Community, and Dazhongsi, supplied by the Zhongguancun technology-service wing to the west and the Xiaoyue River scenario-enabling wing to the east. The operating loop is propose, validate, disclose, convert, disciplined by three hard constraints: failures must be disclosed, the human fallback path may never be slower or costlier, and non-participation is the default. All work is delivered on the organiser-registered provisional rough extents with a topologically seamless land-use partition, recomputed metrics, and phasing that can be recalculated in full once official precise boundaries are published.",
