    "summary": "以铁路延续百年的联锁安全哲学（道岔与信号互锁、冲突即阻断、闭塞安全间隔）为原型，提出AI城市开放治理协议「联锁带」：一轴三站两翼的空间结构、五大功能、三区两翼协同、10张AI场景卡、5类用户画像、3个AI朝圣地标与年度开放运营体系；联锁协议以机器可读JSON开放（CC-BY-4.0）。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the century-old railway interlocking safety philosophy (switch-signal interlock, conflict-blocks-action, block-section safety spacing) as the prototype, this proposal presents the AI-city open governance protocol 'Interlocking Belt': one spine, three stations, two wings; five functions; three key areas in synergy; 10 AI scenario cards; 5 persona profiles; 3 AI pilgrimage landmarks; and an annual open-operation system; the interlocking protocol is open as machine-readable JSON (CC-BY-4.0).",
