    "slug": "jingzhang-ai-meridian",
    "title": "零公里以北 · NORTH OF ZERO——百年京张AI创新带开源城市设计方案",
    "titleEn": "NORTH OF ZERO — An Open-Source Urban Design Proposal for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "京张铁路的零公里标立在走廊南端——方案由此得名『零公里以北』：以遗址公园贯通绿轴为主动脉的一脉三枢、两翼六环结构，六条缝合慢行环重新连接被走廊分隔的城市，12张AI场景卡（附治理运行表：无AI等价路径/停止条件/退出回归，及退役登记与分时段服务承诺）、4类测试验证场景、6类用户画像、4处AI朝圣地标与K0-K9十座站点及其接驳网络，让创新从零公里原点向北生长，回应百年京张AI创新带的全部公告与智能体任务。",
    "summaryEn": "The kilometre-zero marker of the Jing-Zhang Railway stands at the south end of this corridor — hence the name NORTH OF ZERO: a one-meridian-three-hubs-two-wings-six-loops structure on the heritage-park green spine, six suture loops re-stitching a city long divided by the rail corridor, with 12 AI scenario cards (each with a governance operations table entry: non-AI equivalent path / stop conditions / exit and reversion, plus a decommissioning registry and time-banded service commitments), 4 testing-and-validation scenarios, 6 personas, 4 AI pilgrimage landmarks and the ten K0-K9 stations with their interchange network, letting innovation grow northward from the origin and answering every announcement and agent task of the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt.",
