    "titleEn": "EVO-RAIL Jing-Zhang: an Evolvable AI City Belt on a Century-Old Track",
    "summary": "以「可进化轨道 EVO-RAIL」为总体概念，把百年京张铁路从纪念性遗址转译为一条仍在运行、可自我升级的城市轨道系统：数据、算力、模型、人才与场景像列车一样在轨道上单向成环、双向回馈。统筹43.6km²研究范围、11.4km²总体设计范围与368.4ha三处重点区，提出「一站一模、一轨一协议」的三区两翼协同回路、15张AI场景卡、5类用户画像、3个AI朝圣地标与全球AI创新活动体系，全部空间建议均为概念建议（provisional boundary），不替代正式规划。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking \\\"Evolvable Track EVO-RAIL\\\" as the overall concept, this proposal re-reads the century-old Jing-Zhang Railway not as a memorialized heritage but as a living, self-upgrading urban track system along which data, compute, models, talent, and scenarios move like trains in a one-way loop with two-way feedback. It coordinates a 43.6 km² research scope, an 11.4 km² overall design scope, and three 368.4 ha key areas through a \\\"one station one model, one track one protocol\\\" three-areas-two-wings loop, 15 AI scenario cards, 5 user personas, 3 AI pilgrimage landmarks, and a global AI event and operation system. All spatial proposals are conceptual (provisional boundary) and do not replace formal planning.",
