    "id": "zhumoalpha/jingzhang-mindline",
    "slug": "jingzhang-mindline",
    "title": "京张·知行线 The MindLine——百年京张AI创新带开源共创方案",
    "titleEn": "The MindLine — An Open Co-Creation Proposal for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "京张·知行线 The MindLine 以「知行合一」为内核——知是良知、人文与内心，行是行动、科技与铁路之行——把京张铁路遗址公园的线性遗产按「一脉三站两翼」转译为人机共智的城市主线。方案在临时约束范围（provisional）上完成用地、建筑、慢行、蓝绿、动静双院与分期的概念性落图，并以 EPSG:4548 复算指标、12 张带治理三列的 AI 场景卡与 3 处测试验证场景构建可复核的证据链。",
    "summaryEn": "The MindLine takes the unity of knowing and doing (Wang Yangming) as its core — knowing is conscience, the humanities, and the inner life; doing is action, technology, and the running of the railway — and translates the linear heritage of the Jing-Zhang Railway Heritage Park into a city-scale mainline for human-AI co-intelligence organised as one spine, three stations, and two wings. Land use, buildings, walking and cycling, blue-green systems, the paired active-and-still courtyards, and phasing are drawn conceptually on the provisional boundary, with every metric recalculated in EPSG:4548 and an evidence chain built from twelve AI scenario cards carrying three governance columns and three testing and validation scenarios.",
