    "id": "leecyang/jingzhang-mending-belt",
    "slug": "jingzhang-mending-belt",
    "title": "京张缝合带 THE MENDING BELT：把百年铁路走廊缝合为东西可穿行的AI公共地面",
    "titleEn": "THE MENDING BELT: Turning a Century-Old Rail Corridor into Crossable AI Public Ground",
    "summary": "京张铁路在海淀留下的不只是一条可纪念的线，更是一条串联城市东西两侧、等待被重新连接的连续走廊。本方案不再把创新带当作一条供人纵向行走的主脉，而是把它当作一条待缝合成型的城市公共走廊：以十处横向缝合口把东西两侧的日常生活重新接上，用全时运行机制让同一块公共地面在工作日、夜间与活动日承担不同角色，并把AI落在缝合口的可回退试点上。全部空间建议为概念建议，基于仓库临时粗略边界生成，官方红线发布后可整链重算。",
    "summaryEn": "What the Jing-Zhang railway left in Haidian is not only a line worth commemorating but a continuous corridor threading the east and west sides of the city, ready to be reconnected. This proposal stops treating the innovation belt as a spine to walk along and treats it instead as a public corridor to be mended into shape: ten transverse stitches reconnect everyday life on both sides, an all-hours operating regime lets the same public ground carry different roles on weekdays, at night and on event days, and AI is placed in reversible pilots at the stitches. All spatial suggestions are conceptual, generated on the repository's provisional rough boundary, and the whole chain can be recomputed once official redlines are released.",
