    "title": "京张·烟火线 The Hearth Line——百年京张AI创新带开源共创方案",
    "titleEn": "The Hearth Line — An Open Co-Creation Proposal for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "京张·烟火线 The Hearth Line 以「最先进的 AI 城区，看起来应该像生活本身」为内核，把京张铁路遗址公园的线性遗产转译为「一街三市、西巷东岸」的生活性公共长街——晨市、学市、夜市各承一段时辰，AI 退后一步、生活向前一步。方案在临时约束范围（provisional）上完成用地、建筑、慢行与骑手配送、市集型公共空间与南启动分期的概念性落图，以 EPSG:4548 复算 59 项已知指标，并以 12 张带治理三列的生活场景卡、3 处测试验证场景与二十四节气运营日历构建可复核的证据链。",
    "summaryEn": "The Hearth Line is built on one conviction — the most advanced AI district should look like ordinary life — and it translates the linear heritage of the Jing-Zhang Railway Heritage Park into a living public long street organised as one street, three markets, a west lane and an east bank, where a Morning Market, a Learning Market and a Night Market each hold one stretch of the day and AI steps back so that life can step forward. Land use, buildings, walking and cycling, rider delivery lanes, market-type public space and a south-first phasing are drawn conceptually on the provisional boundary, with 59 known metrics recalculated in EPSG:4548 and an evidence chain built from twelve everyday-life scenario cards carrying three governance columns, three testing and validation scenarios, and a twenty-four solar term operating calendar.",
