    "id": "LaoFang114514/jingzhang-ai-post",
    "slug": "jingzhang-ai-post",
    "title": "京张智驿 LAST-MILE AI POST：百年京张AI创新带最后一公里AI服务带城市设计提案",
    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG AI POST: Last-Mile AI Service Belt Urban Design Proposal for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "以“驿”为文化母题，把百年京张铁路“一站一城”的服务传统转译为AI时代的最后一公里服务带：众智园测驿（无人配送与机器人测试验证）、原点社区康教驿（AI+医疗与AI+教育）、大钟寺生活驿（智能原生消费与末端服务）三驿联动，配12张AI场景卡、6类用户画像、5处AI朝圣地标与4个产业测试验证场景；全部空间成果基于临时边界生成并保留精度警示，待正式数据发布后复算。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the cultural motif of the Post (驿), this proposal reinterprets the century-old service tradition of Jing-Zhang railway stations as a last-mile AI service belt: the Zhongzhiyuan Testing Post (unmanned delivery and robot testing), the Origin Community Health-Education Post (AI+health and AI+education), and the Dazhongsi Living Post (AI-native consumption and last-mile services), supported by 12 scenario cards, 6 user personas, 5 AI pilgrimage landmarks and 4 industry test scenarios. All spatial outputs are generated from provisional boundaries with precision warnings and recalculated when official data is released.",
