    "summary": "以企业全生命周期（策源0→1、加速验证1→10、规模集聚10→N）为组织主线，构建“一带三原、双翼一网”的京张源点带 ORIGIN BELT：众智园作为验证原点、北京AI原点社区作为策源原点、大钟寺作为集聚原点，中关村科技服务翼与小月河场景赋能翼提供资本、法务、IP、算力与场景服务网络；全部空间建议为概念建议，基于仓库临时边界生成并可整链复算。",
    "summaryEn": "Organizing the corridor around the AI enterprise full lifecycle (origin 0→1, accelerated validation 1→10, scaled cluster 10→N), we propose 'One Belt, Three Origins, Two Wings, One Network': Zhongzhiyuan Park as the Validation Origin, Beijing AI Origin Community as the Source Origin, Dazhongsi as the Cluster Origin, with the Zhongguancun Technology Service Wing and Xiaoyuehe Scenario Enablement Wing supplying capital, legal, IP, compute and scenario services. All spatial suggestions are concept proposals, generated from the repository's provisional boundary and recomputable end-to-end.",
