    "summaryEn": "Where Iron Rails Meet Neural Networks — The Jingzhang Smart Vein Innovation Belt transforms a century-old railway heritage into a world-class AI innovation corridor. Stretching 11.41 km² along the former Beijing-Zhangjiakou Railway, the proposal follows a 'One Belt · Three Cores · Multi-Scenario · Blue-Green-Walk Composite Loop' spatial framework, designed to serve everyone from open-source developers to neighborhood elders.",
