    "titleEn": "All Life Speaks: An Open Experimental Belt for Multispecies Urban Agents and Environmental Governance along the Centennial Jing-Zhang Corridor",
    "summary": "以 ALS Stack 1.0 为技术底座，将多模态环境 AI、城市生态数字孪生、六个专业智能体和机器可读 Life Letter Protocol 嵌入百年京张的空间—计算双孪生；通过四项 Benchmark 与红队测试，把水、土、树、鸟、昆虫、微气候和市民观察转译为可溯源、可拒答、需人工放行、可申诉与可回滚的公共来信。",
    "summaryEn": "Built on ALS Stack 1.0, this proposal embeds multimodal environmental AI, an urban ecological digital twin, six specialist agents, and the machine-readable Life Letter Protocol in a coupled spatial-computational twin for the Centennial Jing-Zhang corridor. Four benchmarks and red-team tests translate signals from water, soil, trees, birds, insects, microclimate, and civic observation into public letters that are traceable, able to abstain, subject to human authorization, open to appeal, and reversible.",
