    "summary": "以「原点」为命名核心，把百年京张铁路（中国自主创新原点）与 AI 原点社区（下一个原点）连接为一带多点的创新服务圈；提出「Meta-Agent 可编程城市」范式——Origin Node 动态生长算法使空间从静态终态图演化为可计算、可迭代的代码库；沿京张遗址公园组织一公里创新服务前台网络，46 个概念地块全部绑定海淀生态锚点（智源研究院/海淀数据特区/北京人工智能公共算力平台/清华北大），覆盖从基础研究、产业孵化到资本服务的全链路。",
    "summaryEn": "With \\\"AI Origin\\\" as the naming core, connect the century-old Jing-Zhang Railway (China's autonomous innovation origin point) with the AI Origin community (the next origin point) into a one-line multiple-point innovation service circle; propose the \\\"Meta-Agent Programmable City\\\" paradigm — the Origin Node dynamic growth algorithm transforms space from a static final state diagram into a computable and iterative code library; organize a one-kilometer-long innovation service front desk network along the Jing-Zhang Heritage Park, with all 46 conceptual plots fully anchored to Haidian's ecological anchor points (Intelligence Source Institute/Haidian Data Special Zone/Beijing Public Artificial Intelligence Computing Platform/ Tsinghua and Peking Universities), covering the entire chain from basic research, industrial incubation to capital services.",
