    "id": "RanchoGoose/capillary-jingzhang",
    "slug": "capillary-jingzhang",
    "title": "毛细京张：以窄马路、密路网、贴线街墙重组百年京张AI创新带",
    "titleEn": "Fine Jing-Zhang: Reorganize the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt through narrow side streets, dense road networks, and contiguous street facades.",
    "summary": "本方案主张用一个变量重组百年京张AI创新带：街区尺度。以110–180m街区、18m支路、11m巷道、2m退线的窄马路密路网替代超大街区宽马路模式，把提交范围的路网密度提到12.43km/km²、门到门绕行系数从1.555降到1.330，并论证窄街不是怀旧美学而是AI城市调度价值成立的前提。全部指标可从提交GeoJSON复算，缺官方数据的一律标为unknown。",
    "summaryEn": "This proposal advocates for reorganizing the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt at the block scale. It suggests replacing the super-block wide-road pattern with a dense network of narrow streets and alleys, using block sizes of 110–180m, side streets of 18m, alleys of 11m, and setbacks of 2m. This approach aims to increase the road network density within the submission area to 12.43km/km², reduce the door-to-door detour factor from 1.555 to 1.330, and argue that narrow streets are not merely a nostalgic aesthetic but a prerequisite for the value of AI urban scheduling. All metrics can be recalculated from the submitted GeoJSON file, with official data missing being marked as unknown.",
